<title>CYPRUS: Universal Life pre-tax H1 profit up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Universal Life pre-tax H1 profit up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in Cyprus pounds)</p>
<p>					 96	     95</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profits	  866,232   vs     685,411</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	 623,214   vs     475,000</p>
<p>    Total premiums	11,935,651   vs  11,051,475</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Universal Life Ltd. The company announced that it was proceeding with its plans to expand into the banking sector.</p>
<p>Earlier this year it acquired 41 percent of the share capital of Yialousa Savings Bank which it subsequently renamed Universal Savings Bank.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
